Optional runtime dependencies (NOT vendored in this repository)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- PyTorch (BSD-3-Clause), NumPy (BSD-3-Clause), SymPy (BSD-3-Clause)
- Triton (MIT), TileLang (MIT)
- DeepSeek TileKernels (MIT) — optional; used by nanov41/official_mhc.py,
  nanov41/tl_gate.py, nanov41/tl_sinkhorn.py when TILE_KERNELS_PATH is set.
- Hugging Face Transformers / tokenizers / safetensors — optional; only for
  ref/convert.py and ref/generate.py with the official weights/tokenizer.

